IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. BINARYSEARCH.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-EMPLOYEE-TABLE.
   05 WS-EMPLOYEE OCCURS 5 TIMES ASCENDING KEY IS WS-EMP-ID INDEXED BY WS-IDX.
      10 WS-EMP-ID PIC 999.
01 WS-I PIC 9.
01 WS-SEARCH-ID PIC 999.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > 5
        DISPLAY "ENTER EMPLOYEE ID:"
        ACCEPT WS-EMP-ID(WS-I)
    END-PERFORM
    SORT WS-EMPLOYEE ON ASCENDING KEY WS-EMP-ID
    DISPLAY "SORTED EMPLOYEE IDS:"
    PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > 5
        DISPLAY WS-EMP-ID(WS-I)
    END-PERFORM
    DISPLAY "ENTER EMPLOYEE ID TO SEARCH:"
    ACCEPT WS-SEARCH-ID
    SEARCH ALL WS-EMPLOYEE
        AT END DISPLAY "EMPLOYEE NOT FOUND"
        WHEN WS-EMP-ID(WS-IDX) = WS-SEARCH-ID
            DISPLAY "EMPLOYEE FOUND"
            DISPLAY "POSITION: " WS-IDX
    END-SEARCH
    STOP RUN.
